#
#  Vtable for RRFS (Rapid Refresh Forecast System) initialization from the
#  prslev + 2dfld product pair on the 3 km CONUS grid — see
#  image/runner.py download_rrfs.
#
#  Composite table: the atmosphere/surface rows are WPS's
#  Vtable.RAP.pressure.ncep (RRFS prslev is RAP-pressure-shaped: isobaric
#  TT/UU/VV/RH/HGT plus sfc/2m/10m/MSL — with PMSL remapped 198->192: RRFS publishes
#  MSLET (Eta reduction, 0-3-192), not RAP's MSLMA), and the RUC
#  9-level soil rows are lifted from Vtable.raphrrr — the RAP pressure
#  table itself carries NO soil ("Soil fields are in the hybrid-coordinate
#  files"), and without them metgrid writes met_em with no soil
#  dimensions. RRFS 2dfld encodes soil as TSOIL 2-0-2, SOILW 2-0-192, both
#  fixed surfaces type 106, depths 0/1/4/10/30/60/100/160/300 cm.
#
